Z||000000||88formula||07-23-2001||07:46 PM||||What is the flow rating of the stock 95 Camaro 3.4 injectors? I've heard from 17-21 lbs. and hour. Does anyone know and how do you know? Where do you find this information? <P>Thanks<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||87GTZ34||07-23-2001||11:47 PM||||I'm not 100% positive but I think they are 17lbs and the orignal 2.8s are 14lb.  I'll verify and post back tomorrow.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Shaun41178||07-24-2001||01:17 AM||||I have been told teh 3.4 is 17 lbs and the stock Fiero ones are 15.9 lbs/hr  I could be wrong but that is what I remember reading somewhere.  Don't quote me.  Best bet would be to call Marren Motorsports as I am sure they know exactly what they are since I am sure they have tested them <P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds||||reg||1
Z||000003||ironhedno3||07-24-2001||09:57 PM||||2.8 fiero injectors are 14.9..3.4 ironheds are 17..if your 3.4 is highly modified i have some 19lb 3.8 buicks if you need them||||reg||6
